    "//optionalDependencies": "Removed: pinning Linux-x64-only native binaries broke builds on Linux-ARM64 hosts (Vercel migrated some build runners to arm64 in 2024). Modern Rollup, Tailwind oxide, and Lightningcss declare their own per-platform optional deps in their package.json — npm picks the right one automatically based on the install host. Don't reintroduce these pins."
